      "review_scope": "BEC 2024 6.1, 6.4.1-6.4.2 and Table 6.4; printed page 23 / PDF page 29 visually inspected",
      "applicability_note": "Project scope and edition effective dates require explicit review under the official circulars. Table 6.4 checks do not establish recognized load-calculation procedure, HVAC equipment or controls compliance."
    }
